\ Slice 2 dogfood: pack three `u8` channels into an `i32` via homogeneous
\ `i32` arithmetic, then unpack the lowest channel (blue) back to a `u8` via
\ narrowing. No `/`: unpack only isolates blue, per the slice's Q3 resolution.

: pack ( i64 i64 i64 -- i32 )
  | r g b |
  r >i32 65536 >i32 mul
  g >i32 256 >i32 mul
  add
  b >i32
  add ;

: blue ( i32 -- u8 )
  256 >i32 mod >u8 ;

: main ( -- )
  10 20 30 pack
  dup >i64 .          \ prints 660510
  blue >i64 . ;       \ prints 30
